cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NYCH 3.0 TOTE-Loop Knowledge Graph (MG8 family): deterministic encoding of instructional text into auditable T.O.T.E. loops"
abstract: >-
  A Kuzu knowledge graph that is the shared store for the NYCH 3.0 encoder and T.O.T.E. (Test-Operate-Test-Exit) task loops.
  Sentences are encoded with modality operators, actor, action, object and location, bound to TOTE loops by exact structured
  lookup, checked by g8son gates, and recorded in tamper-evident QSON audit files. Includes a deterministic batch harvester for
  public-domain instructional books (with page provenance), a provisional tech.ui domain of canonical UI actions harvested from
  tech help centers, an agent-graded gold set pending human review, and a one-command reproduction package (REVIEW/).
